data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "synth-1", "text": "Drafted 'rb_sas_1inch_mounted_optics' on a 480x185 mm plate: 5x mirror, 3x half wave plate, 3x beam dump, 2x pbs, 1x sampler, 1x vapor cell, 1x photodiode. Rb-87 saturated absorption spectroscopy at 780 nm using 1-inch mounted optics (PyOpticL paper Fig. 2a). An input beam is picked off by HWP1 + PBS1 into the spectroscopy branch, where a beam sampler (BS1) splits it into a 10% probe (reflected) a"}

